  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>InsaneCraft v1.3.1 是官方 InsaneCraft 整合包的最后一次更新。我们将不再提供后续更新或漏洞修复，并且将<u>不再为 InsaneCraft 提供支持</u>。感谢您一直关注本整合包并享受该系列内容！&lt;3<br><br>出镜游玩者：SSundee、Sigils、Henwy、BiffleWiffle 和 JeromeASF。</strong></p>\n<p>+ 250 款疯狂模组<br>+ 包含 Lost Infinity Mod&nbsp;<br>+ 官方整合包<br>+ 经典与新模组<br>+ 免费世界托管！（必要模组）</p>\n<p>终极挑战：收集无限宝石，化身灭霸。</p>\n<p>推荐内存：<br>- 6GB（低）<br>- 8GB（中）<br>- 16GB（高）</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/527180/description_e4cb3795-16f6-4bad-a2a2-408e3ae8caf4.jpg\"><br></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><em><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/suENVN_n3rw?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></em></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-align:center\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8gLD6S73riI?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p>\n<p>模组列表（点击名称访问其模组页面）：</p>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/angry-pixel-the-betweenlands-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">泽地 (MrCompost)<br></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abyssalcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">深渊工艺 (Shinoow)</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abyssalcraft-integration\" rel=\"nofollow\">深渊工艺整合 (Shinoow)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alchemistry\" rel=\"nofollow\">炼金术 (al132)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ambientsounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">环境音效 4 (CreativeMD)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ancient-spellcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">古代法术 (windanesz)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/base\" rel=\"nofollow\">B.A.S.E (lanse505)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bad-wither-no-cookie-reloaded\" rel=\"nofollow\">凋灵不刷饼干重制版 (Kreezxil)</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bewitchment-legacy\" rel=\"nofollow\">魅惑魔法-经典版 (sunconure11)</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" rel=\"nofollow\">植物魔法 (Vazkii)</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/brandons-core\" rel=\"nofollow\">布兰登核心 (brandon3055)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/buildcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">建筑工艺 (Covert_Jaguar)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carry-on\" rel=\"nofollow\">搬运工 (Tschipp)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/champions\" rel=\"nofollow\">英雄挑战 (TheIllusiveC4)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chunkpregenerator\" rel=\"nofollow\">区块预生成器 (Speiger)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corail-tombstone\" rel=\"nofollow\">柯莱尔墓碑 (Corail_31)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crafttweaker\" rel=\"nofollow\">工艺修改器 (Jaredlll08)</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creativecore\" rel=\"nofollow\">创意核心 (CreativeMD)</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic\" rel=\"nofollow\">循环 (Lothrazar)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dimensionaldoors\" rel=\"nofollow\">次元之门 (DimensionalDevelopment)</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.